(Configure security-related HTTP response headers consistently on all responses to harden the application against common) Tj
T* (browser-based attacks.) Tj
T* ( HSTS – enforce HTTPS with a long max-age and includeSubDomains where appropriate. Content-Security-Policy – restrict) Tj
T* (scripts, styles, frames and connections to trusted sources only. Referrer-Policy – limit referrer information sent to other origins.) Tj
T* (X-Content-Type-Options – use nosniff to prevent MIME type confusion. Cookies – set Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite attributes) Tj
T* (on sensitive cookies. Remove unnecessary disclosure headers such as Server and X-Powered-By where possible.) Tj
