(Detects flows where untrusted DOM-derived data \(location, element values, storage, message data\) reaches HTML/JS execution) Tj
T* (sinks \(e.g., innerHTML, document.write, insertAdjacentHTML, location assignment, eval/Function\) without passing through a) Tj
T* (recognized sanitizer.) Tj
