(Recommendation:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.314 g
40. 255.8899999999999864 Td
(Prevent DOM-based XSS by never inserting untrusted strings directly into HTML or executing them as code. Prefer DOM/text) Tj
T* (APIs, safe templating, or a vetted sanitizer and apply context-aware encoding where needed.Primary: Use textContent / innerText) Tj
T* (or create DOM nodes instead of string-based HTML insertion. If you must insert HTML, sanitize it with a vetted library such as) Tj
T* (DOMPurify.Secondary: Apply context-sensitive encoding for attributes and JavaScript contexts, avoid eval/new) Tj
T* (Function/setTimeout with strings, and prefer safe templating engines.Controls: Use Content Security Policy \(CSP\), follow) Tj
T* (least-privilege principles, and validate/allow-list input shapes where practical.Testing: Add unit/browser tests for inline handlers) Tj
T* (and client-side flows that read from location, form inputs...) Tj
